{"name":"Au Gratin","hex":"#ff9d45","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"au gratin","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Covered with a crust of breadcrumbs (and often cheese) then browned under a grill."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/au_gratin"}],"entries":[{"title":"Gratin","blocks":[{"text":"Gratin is a culinary technique in which a dish is topped with a browned crust, often using breadcrumbs, cheese, or egg. The term may be applied to any dish made using this method. Gratin is usually prepared in a shallow dish. A gratin is baked or cooked under an overhead grill or broiler to form a golden crust on top, and it is often served in its baking dish."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Gratin-Dauphinois.jpg/330px-Gratin-Dauphinois.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gratin"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/8.28.12CheeseburgerMacByLuigiNovi1.jpg/500px-8.28.12CheeseburgerMacByLuigiNovi1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/8.28.12CheeseburgerMacByLuigiNovi1.jpg/500px-8.28.12CheeseburgerMacByLuigiNovi1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A macaroni, cheese and meat gratin.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A8.28.12CheeseburgerMacByLuigiNovi1.jpg"}],"sounds":{"au gratin":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/En-us-au_gratin.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f9/En-us-au_gratin.ogg/En-us-au_gratin.ogg.mp3"}]}}}